執行完一遍，最內層的 cout 指令將會執行幾次？
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
for (j = 1; j <= i; j++)
for (k = 1; k <= 20; k++)
cout << “~~ Good Luck ~~” << endl;
(A)n*10
(B)(n+1)*n*5
(C)(n+1)*n*10
(D)(n+1)*n*20

